<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back 111,054 shrs off-market.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back 111,054 shrs off-market.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Friday it had bought back a further 111,054 shares off-market on Thursday, at NZ$6.42 per share, as part of its NZ$1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>On Friday the shares were trading at $6.53, up 10 cents from Thursday's close. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
